WEBVTT

00:09:59.663 --> 00:10:04.764
Allan Okrainec: Today we're going to practice suturing.

00:10:04.764 --> 00:10:06.762
This is how you hold the needle.

00:10:06.762 --> 00:10:12.259
Grab the needle at the tip.

00:10:12.259 --> 00:10:14.717
It's important to be accurate.

00:10:14.717 --> 00:10:18.550
Aim for the black dots.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:21.999
Orient your loop this way.

00:10:21.999 --> 00:10:26.584
Now go ahead and cut.

00:10:26.584 --> 00:10:30.472
Very good Oscar. I'll see you next week.